  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Rule-based: judgement is assigned deterministically by the MACH scorer from harvested signals (stars, maintenance, licence). A genuinely open (MIT), actively developed bioinformatics agent-skill library with healthy adoption (~1.2k stars, 2000+ commits, versioned releases) and a reproducibility-first design. Research tooling, not a clinical device; skills run on the user's own agent/LLM and may carry their own sub-licences.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-11-11",
  "schema:comment": "MIT; built on OpenClaw. Judgement is auto-scored by the harvester from signals. Individual skills may declare own licences + third-party tool deps. Re-verify on next review.",
